          + 64/3*p1ext.Pol1*sqrt2^-1*mdd^2*L6
          - 16/3*p1ext.Pol1*sqrt2^-1*mdd^2*L5
          - 32/3*p1ext.Pol1*sqrt2^-1*mdd^2*L4
          + 64/3*p1ext.Pol1*sqrt2^-1*muu*mdd*L6
